This meta layer contains the meta-tn-jetson-bsp Yocto layer for the NVIDIA Jetson platform. It provides board-specific BSP support, kernel and device-tree configuration, demo applications, graphics and camera integration, and related utilities needed to build and run the system on TN Jetson-based devices.


# Adding the meta-tn-jetson-bsp layer to your build

```bash
bitbake-layers add-layer meta-tn-jetson-bsp
```


